  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Web Lab\r\n\r\nThis is Web Lab - the tool you'll use to build websites. It includes AI Tutor, a built-in AI assistant you can chat with below these instructions.\r\n\r\nThis level is all about exploring Web Lab and having your first interaction with AI Tutor, referencing the otter webpage that's already been built for you.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. In the center panel, find the example prompts. Highlight one, then tap **\"Add to AI Tutor\"** in the menu that appears.\r\n2. In the chat box below, tell AI Tutor to make that change to the webpage. For example, say \"Make this update to the otter website\"\r\n3. Once AI Tutor finishes, check the preview on the far right. If it looks good, click **\"Accept\"** to keep the change and write a short message summarizing what AI tutor did.\r\n\r\n> **Tip:** Click **\"Hide Instructions\"** to give more room to AI Tutor.\r\n\r\nOnce AI tutor has made a change to the webpage, click **Continue**.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
